Z||000001||theogre||07-14-2001||03:38 PM||||It's for 84-86 only. If it's adjustable it probably won't be easy. read the sevice info for the OE TBI. They are esentially the same. These are explained much better in Haynes Fuel injection service book 10220(2111) (This on covers 86-96 so it includes all versions of fiero injection.)||||reg||1
